  "content": "\u003cdiv class=\"field field-name-field-government\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"taxonomy-term taxonomy-term--type-government taxonomy-term--view-mode-strapline ds-1col clearfix\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n      \n      \u003cem class=\"archive-indicator\"\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n    \n      \u003ctime class=\"meta meta__date\" datetime=\"\"\u003e\u003ctime datetime=\"2003-09-05T15:00:00Z\"\u003e6 September 2003\u003c/time\u003e\n\u003c/time\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n  \u003ch1 class=\"article__title\"\u003e\n  Revised Toll Offer\n\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n    \n            \u003cul class=\"meta--ministers\"\u003e\n            \u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"is-archived\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n      \n        Michael Cullen\n\n      \n  \n\n\n\n\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n      \n      \u003c/ul\u003e\n  \n\n    \n      \u003cem class=\"tag tag--portfolio\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"is-archived\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n  \n    Deputy Prime Minister\n\n\n\n\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n            \u003cdiv class=\"prose field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field--item\"\u003e\u003cp\u003eI have received advice from the Tranz Rail Board of the increased offer from TOLL Holdings and their view that this represents greater certainty of value for shareholders.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe revised offer has no effect on the Crown’s Heads of Agreement with TOLL Holdings.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n      ",
  "content_text": "I have received advice from the Tranz Rail Board of the increased offer from TOLL Holdings and their view that this represents greater certainty of value for shareholders. The revised offer has no effect on the Crown’s Heads of Agreement with TOLL Holdings.",
